<facsimile><graphic url="https://www.e-manuscripta.ch/i3f/v20/1078685/manifest"/></facsimile><text><body><div type="letter">
<pb facs="1078686" n="1"/>
  <opener><salute rend="center">Viro Clarissimo atque Incomparabili
      <lb/><rs key="pers_DE-588-118509969" type="person">Johanni Bernoulli</rs>
      <lb/><abbr>S. P. D.</abbr>
      <lb/><rs key="pers_DE-588-102552517" type="person">Petrus Antonius Michelotti</rs></salute></opener>
  <p>Quoniam hac hebdomada responsum, uti sperabam,
      <lb/>ad meas <choice><abbr>d.</abbr><expan>die</expan></choice> ultima pr<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice>teriti Augusti datas non accepi,
      <lb/>unam adhuc ad te mittere epistolam non abs re
      <lb/>fore judico adhoc ut si forte fortuna <rs key="B_991170515019805501" type="letter">prim<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice> ill<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice>
      <lb/>me<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice></rs> per <rs key="place_VER-tirola" type="place">Tyrolim</rs> amandat<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice> perierint, saltem h<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice>c, quod
      <lb/>per <rs key="place_GEO-3182164" type="place">Bergomum</rs> mitto ad Tuas perveniat Manus.<note type="comment" resp="SG">Der vorliegende Brief stimmt mit Michelottis <rs type="letter" key="B_991170515019605501">Brief</rs> vom 22. September 1714 weitgehend überein, enthält aber einzelne Änderungen und Ergänzungen. Dort kündigt Michelotti den Versand über Tirol an; hier nennt er Bergamo als Postweg. Beide Schreiben begründet er mit der ausgebliebenen Antwort auf seinen <rs type="letter" key="B_991170515019805501">Brief</rs> vom 31. August 1714 und der Sorge, dieser könne verloren gegangen sein.</note>
      <lb/><choice><abbr>Illustriss.<hi rend="sup">i</hi></abbr><expan>Illustrissimi</expan></choice> et <choice><abbr>Excell.<hi rend="sup">i</hi></abbr><expan>Excellentissimi</expan></choice> D. D. Patavini <rs type="organisation">Archilyc<choice><orig><g ref="#ehat">ê</g></orig><reg>e</reg></choice>i</rs> <rs key="pers_DE-588-1089924410 pers_DE-588-1111043582 pers_DE-588-1178371670" type="person">Moderatores</rs>
      <lb/>responsum Tuum Vir Doctissime expectant, nec non
      <lb/>scire cupiunt num <rs key="place_GEO-2661604" type="place">Basile<choice><orig><g ref="#ahat">â</g></orig><reg>a</reg></choice></rs> discessurus, Patriamque
      <lb/>derelicturus sis <rs key="place_GEO-3171728" type="place">Patavium</rs> veniendi gratia ad
      <lb/>Mathematicas disciplinas edocendas, salario 1500 Tha<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>lerorum imperialium annuatim Tibi persoluto.
      <lb/>Ego revera ipsis Nobilissimis <rs key="pers_DE-588-1089924410 pers_DE-588-1111043582 pers_DE-588-1178371670" type="person">Moderatoribus</rs> Tui obti<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>nendi spem aliquam feci, si annuatim persolvere
      <lb/>velint 1500 Thaleros imperiales hoc est totidem
      <lb/>uncias argenti; hancque spem deduxi ex humanissi<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>ma Tua <rs key="B_991170515020205501" type="letter">epistola</rs> 18 Iulii exarata, in qua scripsisti
      <lb/>Vir Celeberrime Te ne quidem permotum iri oblat<choice><orig><g ref="#ahat">â</g></orig><reg>a</reg></choice>
      <lb/>summa minori quam 1500 Thalerorum imperialium
      <lb/>hoc est totidem unciarum argenti. Copiam <rs key="B_991170515020205501" type="letter">littera<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>rum</rs> Tuarum <rs key="pers_DE-588-1089924410 pers_DE-588-1111043582 pers_DE-588-1178371670" type="person">Proceribus</rs> meis Amplissimis dedi; ipsi<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>que stipendium 1500 Thalerorum imperialium quod
      <lb/>petivisti exhibent, atque annuatim persolvent: quare
<pb facs="1078687" n="2"/>
      <lb/>reliquum est ut Tu Vir <choice><sic>Clarissme</sic><corr>Clarissime</corr></choice> sine mora <rs key="B_991170515019305501" type="letter">litteris
      <lb/>Tuis iucundissimis</rs><note type="editorial" resp="SG">Vgl. Johann I Bernoullis <rs type="letter" key="B_991170515019305501">Brief</rs> vom 20. Oktober 1714. Er nimmt darin unmittelbar auf Michelottis <rs type="letter" key="B_991170515019405501">Brief</rs> vom 5. Oktober 1714 Bezug.</note> me admonitum facias de tuo ad<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>ventu, quem cum Proceribus meis, multisque aliis
      <lb/>Viris doctis ipse exopto. Uti dicebam in <rs key="B_991170515019805501" type="letter">pr<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice>cedentibus
      <lb/>meis</rs> progressu temporis poteris substituere Agnatum
      <lb/>Tuum Doctissimum <rs key="pers_DE-588-119166895" type="person">Nicolaum</rs> siquidem <rs key="place_GEO-3171728" type="place">Patavina
      <lb/>Urbs</rs> non arriserit: C<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice>ter<choice><orig><g ref="#ugrav">ù</g></orig><reg>u</reg></choice>m aer patavinus optimus
      <lb/>est, et temperamento tuo conducet. <rs key="place_GEO-3164603" type="place">Veneti<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice></rs> omnibus
      <lb/>iucundissim<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice> fortasse non displicebunt vacationum
      <lb/>tempore, quo cubiculum Domi me<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice> sine expensis
      <lb/>Tibi semper paratum erit. Stipendium oblatum
      <lb/>1500 Thalerorum imperialium ne respuas rogo,
      <lb/>et vocationibus tam honorificis ne relucteris de<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>precor saltem ne labores meis pro Vobis libentis<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>sime impensi evadant prorsus irriti et frustranei.</p>
  <closer><salute>Vale et fave Vir omni virtutum genere pr<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice>stantissime.</salute>
<dateline>Dabam <rs key="place_GEO-3164603" type="place">Venetiis</rs> <choice><abbr>a. d.</abbr><expan>ad diem</expan></choice> <date when="1714-09-23">23 Septembris 1714</date></dateline></closer>
  <postscript><p>P. S. Salutem plurimam meo nomine dicito Illustrissi<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>mo Fratri tuo <rs key="pers_DE-588-135542286" type="person">Nicolao</rs> Status Vestri Consiliario, nec
        <lb/>non Clarissimo Agnato Tuo <rs key="pers_DE-588-119166895" type="person">Nicolao</rs>. Quin Illustrissimus
        <lb/>Frater Tuus <rs key="pers_DE-588-135542286" type="person">Nicolaus</rs> meam acceperit <rs key="B_991170517053105501" type="letter">epistolam</rs>
        <lb/>ei inclusam, quam ultima <choice><abbr>d.</abbr><expan>die</expan></choice> transacti Augusti
<pb facs="1078688" n="3"/>
        <lb/>per <rs key="place_VER-tirola" type="place">Tyrolim</rs> ad Te amandavi, haud ambigo.</p></postscript>
<pb facs="1078689" n="4" type="empty"/>
</div></body></text></TEI>
